# Internal docs, build scripts and Apps Script source. 93 of these were being served
# publicly at ifm-deploy.vercel.app (verified 200 on 7 Sep 2026) — build briefs, sheet
# IDs, sync scripts. Nothing the site renders fetches a .md/.py/.gs, so blocking them
# costs nothing. Add a "!" exception below if a page ever genuinely needs one.
*.md
*.py
*.gs
*.bak
*.orig
!3b-hero.mp4
!ifm-logo-gold-coins-spin.mp4

# Content-hub videos that MUST ship, or their catalogue rows 404 on the live site.
# The blanket *.mp4 above exists to keep ~778MB of raw footage out of the deploy;
# these are the small, already-compressed DERIVATIVES the hub actually links to.
# SIZE BUDGET (keep it, or this problem comes back): thumbs <=25KB, preview clips <=200KB.
# Masters (full-res photos, finished reels) belong on Drive, never here.
!content/teasers/*.mp4
!content/game-assets/*.mp4
!content/clips/*.mp4

